      ],
      "source": "https://www.longislandpress.com/2024/09/09/the-origins-of-new-hyde-park/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After World War II, former farmland across western Nassau County was gradually turned into the suburban neighborhoods that define North New Hyde Park today.",
